WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.502
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:03.803
We hope you're all doing well.

00:00:03.803 --> 00:00:06.639
And now if you don't mind, we're
going to get to the news.

00:00:06.639 --> 00:00:09.408
The White House announced over
the weekend that a third batch

00:00:09.408 --> 00:00:11.143
of classified documents
was found

00:00:11.143 --> 00:00:13.245
at President Biden's
Delaware home.

00:00:13.245 --> 00:00:17.116
You know, finding new ones
every few days isn't helping.

00:00:17.116 --> 00:00:18.918
What are you guys
doing over there?

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:22.021
Searching one drawer at a time?

00:00:22.021 --> 00:00:24.824
Did he hide the documents
in an advent calendar?

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:26.926
[ Audience laughs ]

00:00:26.926 --> 00:00:29.528
That's right, a third batch of
classified documents was found

00:00:29.528 --> 00:00:31.163
at President Biden's
Delaware home

00:00:31.163 --> 00:00:33.632
in a room next
to his garage.

00:00:33.632 --> 00:00:38.170
Man, is there a more Biden
hiding place than the room

00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:40.306
next to the garage?

00:00:40.306 --> 00:00:42.541
Just telling neighbors, "Yeah,
sure, you can borrow

00:00:42.541 --> 00:00:45.778
the weed whacker. It's in
the room next to the garage."

00:00:45.778 --> 00:00:48.514
If you hit the nuclear codes,
you've gone too far.

00:00:48.514 --> 00:00:49.815
[ Audience laughs ]

00:00:49.815 --> 00:00:52.919
President Biden visited Ebenezer
Baptist church in Atlanta

00:00:52.919 --> 00:00:54.920
yesterday to honor
Martin Luther King Jr..

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:56.956
Became the first sitting
President to deliver

00:00:56.956 --> 00:00:58.291
a Sunday sermon.

00:00:58.291 --> 00:00:59.893
And I'll tell you what,
when he was done,

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:02.495
there was not an open eye
in the house.

00:01:02.495 --> 00:01:05.498
[ Audience laughs ]

00:01:06.699 --> 00:01:09.635
After the FAA last week
temporarily grounded

00:01:09.635 --> 00:01:12.472
all domestic flight departures
due to a computer outage,

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:15.041
it's been reported
that the software responsible

00:01:15.041 --> 00:01:16.943
is years away from
a potential update.

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:20.379
Really? Because I feel like if
you just put Apple in charge,

00:01:20.379 --> 00:01:22.381
they'll update it
every three months.

00:01:22.381 --> 00:01:23.683
[ Audience laughs ]

00:01:23.683 --> 00:01:26.385
New York mayor Eric Adams
yesterday visited El Paso,

00:01:26.385 --> 00:01:28.721
Texas, to tour immigration
facilities and meet

00:01:28.721 --> 00:01:29.755
with local officials.

00:01:29.755 --> 00:01:31.391
Dude, you're the mayor
of New York.

00:01:31.391 --> 00:01:36.096
Why are you wandering all over
the country like a dad at Sears?

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:37.630
"I'm going to go look
at the tires."

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:40.633
"Dad, we're here
for my school supplies."

00:01:40.633 --> 00:01:41.934
[ Audience laughs ]

00:01:41.934 --> 00:01:44.103
Lottery officials have announced
that the Mega Millions

00:01:44.103 --> 00:01:49.809
$1.35 billion jackpot was won by
a single ticket holder in Maine.

00:01:49.809 --> 00:01:51.911
And if you're wondering what
they're going to buy with that,

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:53.279
Maine.

00:01:53.279 --> 00:01:55.648
[ Audience laughs ]

00:01:55.648 --> 00:01:58.150
The national weather service has
warned that a recent drop

00:01:58.150 --> 00:02:01.588
in temperatures in Florida could
cause iguanas to enter

00:02:01.588 --> 00:02:05.458
a dormant state and fall out of
trees, which has left residents

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:08.794
of Florida scrambling
for recipes.

00:02:08.794 --> 00:02:11.831
[ Audience laughs ]

00:02:16.402 --> 00:02:18.904
"Mom, what's in the pasta?"

00:02:18.904 --> 00:02:21.941
[ Audience laughs ]

00:02:23.342 --> 00:02:26.145
The Dallas Zoo was closed
on Friday

00:02:26.145 --> 00:02:29.215
until a 4-year-old
clouded leopard named Nova

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:30.750
was returned to her habitat.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.785
Oh, you mean the jungle?

00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:33.986
[ Audience laughs ]

00:02:33.986 --> 00:02:38.558
News flash -- no leopard's
habitat is Dallas.

00:02:38.558 --> 00:02:42.661
Leopard print, sure,
but not leopard.

00:02:42.661 --> 00:02:45.698
[ Audience laughs ]

00:02:47.100 --> 00:02:48.901
And finally,
Italy's most wanted man,

00:02:48.901 --> 00:02:52.004
an alleged organized crime boss,
Matteo Messina Denaro,

00:02:52.004 --> 00:02:54.106
was arrested today
after 30 years on the run.

00:02:54.106 --> 00:02:56.775
He's expected to serve
at least two life sentences,

00:02:56.775 --> 00:02:58.644
plus five years consulting

00:02:58.644 --> 00:03:01.214
on an HBO series
about his life.

00:03:01.214 --> 00:03:02.882
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

